      "name": "[Blueprint][Alice] Duelist's Etiquette - Lv.50",
      "desc": "Use this Blueprint at the Smart Workshop to unlock the recipe for Alice's exclusive Tactical Prism. Obtained through investigations or purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\nItem Effect: Increases this unit's Anomaly Buildup Rate by 8% and Anomaly Proficiency by 8. For every 22k Gear Coins held, gain 1 extra stack of this effect, stacking up to 4 times.\nWhen the 5th hit of Alice's <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Attack]</color>, or <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate]</color> hits an enemy, accumulate <color=#FFFFFF>[Marks]</color>. When an attack hits an enemy with full <color=#FFFFFF>[Marks]</color>, consume all <color=#FFFFFF>[Marks]</color> to trigger <color=#F0D12B>[Polarity Assault]</color> and cause all DMG dealt by this unit to ignore 30% of the target's DMG RES for 30s.",
